 ;; Added 2026-08-31 with the runner rewrite. Until then
 ;; `verify_value_handle_arena.clj` implemented the arena state machine in
 ;; Clojure and compared THAT against the expected values below, so these two
 ;; vectors passed whatever the compiled object did. The object is now executed
 ;; against a supplied memory image; the layout the runner writes comes from
 ;; `:header` and `:slots` above rather than being restated here.
